                        McNamara and Seaborg states [<hi rendition="#italic">text
                        not declassified</hi>] by Kennedy, at
                        Seaborg’s recommendation, for October
                    10. (Washington National Records Center, RG 330,
                        OSD Files: FRC 65 A 3464, Atomic 400.112 8 Apr 61 (Jun-Nov 61))</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
